# Design direction
Forest matcha #395442, sage #879B74, wasabi #C6D940, warm paper, oversized typography, circular stickers, candid dogs and an outdoors-first editorial layout. Uses the actual Goodboys wordmark. Photo crops come from your supplied boards and are temporary references; their reuse rights have not been verified.

# Independent-business references
Reviewed 9 October 2026. These are useful reference examples, not an objective ranking or endorsement.
- Dogs at Heart — https://www.dogsatheart.net/ : clearly separated group/solo/visit services, personal founder story, explicit coverage. Adapted the service clarity and human introduction.
- Gentle Paws — https://www.gentle-paws.co.uk/ : dog-centred positioning and a simple introductory meeting CTA. Adapted the low-friction meet-and-greet enquiry.
- Maw and Paws — https://www.mawandpawsdogwalking.com/ : independent small-group positioning. Adapted the warm, local business tone.

Copy and layout are original. No competitor photos, testimonials or brand assets were copied. No credentials, location, rates or customer counts were invented.

